## Topics

event contracts, deduplication, match quality, attribution windows and restatement,
profit and contribution formulas, landed cost, return rate, incrementality and
holdouts, consent and tracking loss, UTM integrity.

## Look for

Exact event names and required parameters. What breaks deduplication. Match quality
thresholds and what moves them. Attribution window behaviour and when numbers
restate. **Formulas with every term defined, including whether tax and shipping are
in or out.** That last clause is the whole module in one line.

Prefer platform documentation, which is tier 1 and the only thing that can be.

## Skip

Attribution vendor comparisons. Anything selling a tool without explaining the
mechanic. Dashboard tours that do not define the metrics. Near-identical beginner
tutorials for the same analytics product, of which this folder already has 3.

## Scope mix

Almost all baseline. Most of the roughly 100 baseline cards in the whole library
come from this folder.

## Done when

You can write the exact list of things that must be true before the system trusts a
number, and every item has a source behind it.
